                                "sense_id": "fe3836a3-274f-3256-b3b2-5f4bf052e69f",
                                "text": "We assume that DWT coefficients belong to a codeblock that is divided by its quantization step size in advance and the two codebooks, C⁰ and C¹, for the two quantizers can be defined as […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
